Z||000035||Haze_Performance||07-31-2001||11:05 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by MR-BAD:<BR><B>i am not saying no names or anything but i i know some of you Fiero people better back off the MR2 i am not trying to start a war or anything but the MR2 is way better than the fiero<P><BR>   <IMG SRC="http://mrbad2.homestead.com/mrbadspage.html">   <P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>We need an IQ test before we allow MR2 morons to post here. The Fiero was made for only 5 years you fool. In those 5 years the Fiero was far more popular than ANY MR2 made. You come here to spew you brand of ignorance & you don't bring any facts. Of course the newer MR2's are more popular. There NEW you idiot!! If the Fiero was still made today it would be a type of Firebird. Your precious little MR2 wouldn't even come close to the performance or styling. Lastly, I would like to say... I think the newer MR2's are nice cars. I have nothing against them.  <P>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.ws6fiero.com" TARGET=_blank>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/indyclick.gif">   <BR></A><BR><FONT SIZE="1"><FONT COLOR="red"><B>Click above to visit my website.</B></FONT></FONT><p>[This message has been edited by Haze_Performance (edited 07-31-2001).]||||reg||13
