Z||000070||TheDingo8MyBaby||08-01-2001||12:37 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by AusFiero:<BR>[B] MR2s get mistaken for what?  Oh thats right Mazdas and Nissans. Why? because they are just another Japanese mass production car that look pretty much the same as all Japanese mass production cars. <BR><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>First of all, I dont care what you guys think of my car. I really like your guy's cars. Their engine is in the right place. I really dont have a problem with you guys.<P>The Reason I posted this quote above is because I actually get a lot of people that tell me my car looks like a Fiero. I dont find this offensive, but maybe you guys will?<P>I personally like the styling of both cars, but the price was right on my car and the insurance is great, so I'll keep my mr2.<P>You guys are doing just waht Mr-Bad wants you to. Dont take that crap. We all enjoy cars..lets not let us get at eachother's throats like this<P><p>[This message has been edited by TheDingo8MyBaby (edited 08-01-2001).]||||reg||1
