Z||000077||KnightRyder31||08-01-2001||02:30 PM||||HAHAHAHA!!!!<BR>MR2's... HAHAHAHA!<BR>I beat a first gen. MR in my 1990 Ply. Colt(almost no clutch left either)!<BR>HAHAHAHA!<BR>It wasn't even close, I whooped him!<BR>Just think how bad your MR2's would look next to a 90's model Fiero IF they were made.<BR>Or even next to ANY modded Fiero (I know of a couple). Hell, to tell you the truth, I'd rather have any good cond. Fiero GT over a NEW MR2. Sure the new MR2 would beat the Fiero in performence, BUT... the Fiero still looks better. I also think that this thread should be closed, there is no point in this topic. Maybe under O/T but not under General FIERO chat. You MR2 guys need to go back to your own board and quit bothering us all of the time with all of your BS. I for one, am sick of it. At first you guys were being cool, telling us not to mind that fag mrbad or whatever. But then you guys started up where he left off. And come on, saying that you see rusted out Fiero's(must be one of those rare metal body conversions???) all over the place is just plain ignorant... your asking to get bitched at!<BR>So, if you guys have any sense of intelligence, just drop this and leave.<BR>Its just much easier to leave each other alone and not come to each other's forums.<BR>Thats just the way it is.<BR>I'm done for now, I just hope that this thread will be closed soon.||||reg||1
