Z||000092||Songman||08-01-2001||06:50 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by FieroPerformance:<BR><B>MR2 copied the Fiero. Plain and simple. <BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I can't say one way or another where Toyota got their original MR2 design. Sure the Fiero did come out first, but the Fiero is nothing but an Americanized X1/9, which was designed by Bertone... you may have seen his design before on some Ferrari's. Realistically, there is nothing original about the Fiero or the MR2. They are both copies of longstanding designs. Too bad neither of the later two ever really offered a factory Targa and the X1/9 and the Ferrari's did...<P>This thread is getting old. There is so much untrue information here on both sides that it just getting ridiculous. Let's find something else to talk about...<P><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
Z||000093||Gragon||08-01-2001||06:51 PM||||I think everyone will agree the "my car is better than your car" debait is pointless.  If there was one all mighty, perfect car out there, that we all loved, we would all own one wouldn't we?<P>You have to respect cars for what they are, doesn't mean you have to like them all.  I happen to like MR2s.  The members on this board happen to like Fieros.  Both cars have good and bad points.<P>To come here and make a post that MR2s are better than Fieros is kind of like me walking up to a 6'-6" Pro Wrestler and telling him he looks like a fag.  I am going to most likely get the ****  kicked out of me, correct?  Seems to me the original thread post was made as flame bait, pure and simple.<P>Please understand that the post made here by your member MR-BAD does not reflect the feelings of the majority of the people I know on the MR2 board and community.  Don't condem us by the words and actions of one individual.  Most of us play very nice  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>91 MR2 Turbo<BR>89 MR2 SC<BR>01 PT Cruiser||||reg||7
