Z||000118||Raptor13x||08-02-2001||03:21 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by AusFiero:<BR><B>Fieros often get mistaken for Ferraris outside of the USA. MR2s get mistaken for what?  Oh thats right Mazdas and Nissans. Why? because they are just another Japanese mass production car that look pretty much the same as all Japanese mass production cars. <BR>I wont even start to name the amount of USA cars under $100,000 that look better than the MR2. That comment has just proved how one eyed you are. </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>haha, now THAT IS FUNNY!  Are you sure you even know what an MR2 is?  I am talking about the second generation models, cuz thats what I own.  About the only car they are mistaken for is a Ferrari.  Fieros are a joke in the United States (thats not coming from me, or the MR2 guys, thats a fact.) It gets no respect from the domestic guys cuz it doesnt carry a V8 and weigh 4500 pounds, and no respect from the import guys, cuz its a car that so many people put rediculous body kits on to pose as other cars.<P>You could hardly call the second gen MR2 mass produced, there are an extreme few in the world. Japan's sports cars all have very unique and easily distinguished appearances. Its the damned sedans and SUVs that all look alike.  The MR2 looks like no other Japanese car, and name one car that looks better than an mkii MR2.  I'd like to hear your input.<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000119||Raptor13x||08-02-2001||03:28 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Formula:<BR><B>best looking car under $100k......<BR>Vipers look better then an mr2,<BR>Corvettes look better then an mr2,<BR>Mustangs look better then an mr2,<BR>Firebirds look better then an mr2,<BR>Camaros look better then an mr2,<P>Those are all made in america too....<BR>if you want to get technical,<BR>Supra, NSX, Espirit, Carrera, Boxter, SLK, just to name a few...<P>This is my opinion though, so its cool if you think your car is the best looking car around..... a little bit egotistical but cool.  <BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>You MUST be joking. Either that or you are blind.  Vipers... MAYBE. I personally prefer the MR2 appearance, but thats a judgement call. <BR>As far as Vettes, Mustangs, Firebirds, and Camaros, if you think they look better you might want to stop snorting cocaine.  Especially Mustangs... freakin hidious.  I'd rather drive a Hyundai.<P>Supra- Not all that attractive, but I love the easy horsepower<BR>NSX- they are beautiful cars, but they cost about 100K<BR>Espirit- Nice car, but dont they cost more than 100K???<BR>Carrera- I dont really like the look of Porsche all that much.<BR>Boxster- Not all that attractive<BR>SLK- Nice, but nowhere near the beauty of an MR2<P>Maybe I'm biased, maybe I'm egotistical, but I just love how my car looks<BR>||||reg||1
