Z||000135||Slid||08-02-2001||02:50 PM||||MR-BAD shut up, nobody on either of the boards like you.<P>Besides that, I don't think there is any reason our two boards should be seperated and we should mind our own business.  I think a lot of Fieros look pretty nice, I was concidering buying one when I was looking for a car.  It was Maroon, looked really nice, good looking body on it, its still for sale actually, I see it every day I go to work  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Fieros are nice cars and so are MR2s, I bought an MR2 instead of a Fiero because I have just had better luck with imports than I have with domestics.  I get about 34mpg in my MR2, I'd imagine Fieros get similiar gas mileage too.<P>It would be pretty cool to have a meet where a bunch of MR2 owners and Fiero owners get together.<P>For those that think the MR2 is an ugly car, try looking at them between 91 and 95, they are very attractive cars.  Some Fieros don't look very good, but some are really nice, same with any car.<P>I think it would be nice if we could all just ignore this LOSER MR-BAD, hes some 12year old on his summer vacation trying to start things.<P>Ah well, see you all around, come over to our board too if you want!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
