Z||000153||Tonker||08-02-2001||10:25 PM||||MR2 guys: I love your cars. Mk II's are sweet-ass!! If any of you guys live in Ottawa, feel free to take me for a ride! Never been in a mk. II   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>My friend has a mk I. We've compared and both respect what each car has to offer. My stock 86 GT spanks my buddy's stock 87 MR2 from a standstill, but I can see where his handling in corners is much nicer and more responsive. When it comes to styling why even bother to argue? You're going to like one style I'm going to like another. I think my GT has nicer style than the MR2 mk I, but my buddy obviously doesn't agree. <P>Like others have pointed out doesn't make much sense to compare an 84-88 Fiero with a mid-90's MR2 - obviously the technology is going to have improved.<P>Welcome to the forum guys. Hope to see you around after this thread dies.    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Syug, oreif ot hctiws ot etal oot ton s'ti.<P>Edit: Damn fat fingers and stupid brain..<P><BR>------------------<BR>Black '86 Fiero GT.<BR>ICQ: 7813479<BR><BR>[This message has been edited by Tonker (edited 08-02-2001).]<p>[This message has been edited by Tonker (edited 08-02-2001).]||||reg||6
